      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ad Billingesgate si advenisset una navicula—I obolus tolonei dabatur; si maior et haberet siglas— unum den.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a small ship came to Billingsgate, 1 half-penny was paid as toll; if a larger ship with sails, 1 penny was paid.</ab>
